## Context: Errand failed because of distance, time or navigation; consumed acorn is lost.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.abort=§7L’écureuil perd son chemin et abandonne. Le gland est perdu.
## Context: A frightened squirrel aborts its gift errand. The already accepted acorn is not returned.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.alarmed=§7L’écureuil prend peur et abandonne sa course.
## Context: Squirrel returns and drops an item gift at the player feet.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.gift=§fL’écureuil revient en trottinant et dépose quelque chose à tes pieds.
## Context: Acorn is consumed, squirrel runs away to search for a gift before returning.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.accept=§fL’écureuil saisit le gland et file dans les fourrés.
## Context: No standable away point could be found for the gift errand; acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.no_path=§7L’écureuil renifle le gland, regarde autour de lui et reste sur place. Il n’a nulle part où courir.
## Context: Squirrel is on its ten-minute gift cooldown; not a claim that it has eaten too much. Acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.full=§7L’écureuil renifle le gland, mais s’occupe de ses réserves. Réessaie plus tard.
## Context: A Guest (Harmony 0 to +9) has not yet earned Friend status (Harmony +10); acorn offer is refused and the item is kept.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.untrusted=§7L’écureuil renifle le gland et t’observe, mais ne te fait pas encore confiance.
## Context: An acorn offer is refused because the player's Harmony is below 0 (Uneasy, Shunned or Hated band); acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.squirrel.restless=§7L’écureuil fuit ton esprit agité.
## Context: Guidance ended unsuccessfully. Offering another acorn can resume toward the saved gift spot.
lothlorien.message.deer.abort=§7Le cerf blanc perd son chemin et te laisse partir. Un autre gland pourrait l’inciter à repartir.
## Context: Leashing the deer during guidance ends the session; it is not killed or untamed.
lothlorien.message.deer.stop_leashed=§7Le cerf blanc est tenu en laisse et cesse de te guider.
## Context: Successful guidance ends and a plantable Great Mallorn nut is dropped in moss.
lothlorien.message.deer.gift=§fLe cerf blanc s’arrête et baisse la tête. Quelque chose brille dans la mousse : une noix de grand mallorn.
## Context: Guidance begins, acorn is consumed; instruct the player to follow the white deer.
lothlorien.message.deer.accept=§fLe cerf blanc prend le gland, relève la tête et se tourne. Suis-le.
## Context: No navigable first waypoint toward an existing gift spot; acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.no_path=§7Le cerf blanc regarde autour de lui, mais ne trouve aucun passage.
## Context: Guidance is refused while white deer is attached to a lead. Lead means the rope item, not leadership; acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.leashed=§7Le cerf blanc ne te guidera pas tant qu’il est tenu en laisse.
## Context: No suitable gift destination in loaded Lothlorien terrain; acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.no_spot=§7Le cerf blanc renifle le gland, regarde autour de lui et reste. Il n’a nulle part où te guider d’ici.
## Context: Each white deer gives a Great Mallorn nut only once. It already gave its gift; offered acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.gifted=§7Le cerf blanc effleure le gland du museau et le laisse. Il a déjà offert son cadeau.
## Context: White deer refuses guidance because the player's Harmony is below 0 (Uneasy, Shunned or Hated band); acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.restless=§7Le cerf blanc fuit ton esprit agité.
## Context: White deer gift guidance needs Friend status (Harmony +10), even though a Guest can approach the deer. Acorn is kept.
lothlorien.message.deer.untrusted=§7Le cerf blanc t’observe, mais ne te fait pas encore confiance.
## Context: Tooltip line 3. Plant the nut on grass or dirt. Full tooltip also explains giant tree and space requirements.
lothlorien.message.nut.lore.plant=§7À planter sur de l’herbe ou de la terre.
## Context: Tooltip line 2. Dimensions are Minecraft blocks: approximate width 40 and height 50. Full tooltip also explains giant tree and planting surface.
lothlorien.message.nut.lore.space=§7Espace : environ 40 de large et 50 de haut.
## Context: Tooltip line 1 of gifted Great Mallorn nut. Flet means wooden platform in the giant tree. Full tooltip explains tree size and planting surface.
lothlorien.message.nut.lore.tree=§7Donne un mallorn géant avec plateforme.
## Context: Mounting refused: unicorn is bonded to a different player.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.other_owner=§7Cette licorne est liée à quelqu’un d’autre.
## Context: Third accepted offer creates a permanent bond to this player; now rideable without a saddle.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.trust3=§fLa licorne incline sa corne devant toi. Elle est désormais tienne et n’a pas besoin de selle.
## Context: Second accepted Elanor offer; flower consumed, trust stage 2 of 3.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.trust2=§fLa licorne prend l’elanor dans ta main.
## Context: First accepted Elanor offer; flower consumed, trust stage 1 of 3.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.trust1=§fLa licorne renifle l’elanor et t’observe.
## Context: Less than ten seconds since previous offer; flower is kept. Turning over means examining, not rotating a block.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.wait=§7La licorne examine encore la fleur. Laisse-lui un instant.
## Context: Unicorn is alarmed and refuses the offer; flower is kept.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.alarmed=§7La licorne est trop effrayée pour accepter quoi que ce soit.
## Context: Player lacks Friend status (is a Guest, Harmony 0 to +9); flower is kept.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.untrusted=§7La licorne observe la fleur et t’observe aussi, mais ne te fait pas encore confiance.
## Context: Elanor offer refused because the player's Harmony is below 0 (Uneasy, Shunned or Hated band); flower is kept.
lothlorien.message.unicorn.restless=§7La licorne fuit ton esprit agité.
## Context: Friend status gained: the player's Harmony reached +10 inside Lothlorien after peaceful time. Gender-neutral announcement of woodland trust. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.friend.gained=§aLothlórien te compte désormais parmi ses amis.
## Context: Friend status lost: Harmony dropped below +10 after a deed (a kill). Gender-neutral announcement. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.friend.lost=§7Lothlórien ne te compte plus parmi ses amis.
## Context: Short action-bar label for the Friend band (Harmony +10), shown inside the forest. Use an impersonal friendship label to avoid assigning gender to the player. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.status.friend=Amitié de Lothlórien
## Context: Growth collision warning identifies sprout coordinates, translated obstacle block name and obstacle coordinates. Use Block.localizationKey; never derive a fake English block name from its namespace ID.
lothlorien.message.mallorn.blocked=§6La pousse de grand mallorn en %s ne peut pas grandir. Obstacle : %s en %s.
## Context: Planting warning for Great Mallorn nut: giant tree with a flet (wooden platform). Reserve about 40x40 horizontal blocks, 50 above and 5 below; light required, built blocks prevent growth. Breaking sprout returns nut.
lothlorien.message.mallorn.planted=§6La noix de grand mallorn donne un arbre géant avec une plateforme en bois : environ 40 blocs de large et 50 de haut, avec des racines profondes de 5 blocs. Il lui faut de la lumière et un espace sans constructions. Casse la pousse pour récupérer la noix.
## Context: Bone meal is explicitly refused; growth remains governed by natural random ticks and light.
lothlorien.message.mallorn.no_bonemeal=§7Un grand mallorn ne se laisse pas presser.
## Context: Debug depth class: outside the Lothlorien biome, not outside a building.
lothlorien.message.depth.outside=extérieur
## Context: Debug depth class: within 16 blocks of the biome border.
lothlorien.message.depth.edge=lisière
## Context: Debug depth class: within 40 blocks of the biome border, beyond edge.
lothlorien.message.depth.inner=intérieur
## Context: Debug depth class: farther than 40 blocks from the biome border.
lothlorien.message.depth.heart=cœur
## Context: A question mark marks an incomplete depth estimate due to unloaded probes.
lothlorien.message.depth.uncertain=%s ?
## Context: Developer diagnostic displayed to players who invoke the relevant /scriptevent command: %s%s§r [%s] hostiles r%s: %s in Lórien / %s. Translate labels; retain technical tokens and commands.
lothlorien.message.debug.actionbar=%s%s§r [%s] hostiles r%s : %s en Lórien / %s
## Context: Developer diagnostic displayed to players who invoke the relevant /scriptevent command: [lothlorien] depth: %s -> %s. Translate labels; retain technical tokens and commands.
lothlorien.message.depth.changed=[lothlorien] profondeur : %s -> %s
## Context: Developer diagnostic displayed to players who invoke the relevant /scriptevent command: [lothlorien] depth %s (nearest border ~%s blocks); worst case %s probes, %s ms per estimate (average of %s). Translate labels; retain technical tokens and commands.
lothlorien.message.depth.report=[lothlorien] profondeur %s (lisière la plus proche ~%s blocs) ; au maximum %s sondages, %s ms par estimation (moyenne sur %s)
## Context: Developer diagnostic displayed to players who invoke the relevant /scriptevent command: [lothlorien] debug readout on. Translate labels; retain technical tokens and commands.
lothlorien.message.debug.on=[lothlorien] affichage de débogage activé
## Context: Developer diagnostic displayed to players who invoke the relevant /scriptevent command: [lothlorien] debug readout off. Translate labels; retain technical tokens and commands.
lothlorien.message.debug.off=[lothlorien] affichage de débogage désactivé
## Context: Pack title or description for lothlorien_rp. BP means behavior pack; RP means resource pack. Keep mod brands unchanged.
pack.name=Lothlorien — Pack de ressources
## Context: Pack title or description for lothlorien_rp. BP means behavior pack; RP means resource pack. Keep mod brands unchanged.
pack.description=Pack de ressources de Lothlorien : textures forestières, modèles, sons et textes.
## Context: Resource-pack appearance setting: per-player visual choice. Pretty boats switches to a more detailed boat model; no gameplay changes.
lothlorien.settings.appearance=Lothlorien : réglages visuels (chaque joueur choisit les siens).
## Context: Resource-pack appearance setting: per-player visual choice. Pretty boats switches to a more detailed boat model; no gameplay changes.
lothlorien.settings.pretty_boats=Bateaux de mallorn plus détaillés
## Context: Interaction prompt for catching a firefly in a glass bottle. Uses one bottle and gives a bottle containing the insect.
action.interact.lothlorien.catch_firefly=Capturer une luciole
## Context: Elven Warden: a bow-armed elven guardian of Lothlorien, defends the woods and the tree villages against monsters. Warden here means guard or protector.
entity.lothlorien:elven_warden.name=Gardien elfique
## Context: Creative spawn egg for Elven Warden. Spawn Egg is the Minecraft item type; do not translate as an animal-laid egg.
item.spawn_egg.entity.lothlorien:elven_warden.name=Œuf d’apparition : Gardien elfique
## Context: Action-bar label while the player is in the Guest band (Harmony 0 to +9): welcome, but not yet trusted. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.status.guest=Hospitalité de Lothlórien
## Context: Action-bar label while the player is in the Uneasy band (Harmony -1 to -14): the forest is uneasy about the player. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.status.uneasy=Malaise en Lothlórien
## Context: Action-bar label while the player is in the Shunned band (Harmony -15 to -29): the forest turns away from the player. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.status.shunned=Rejet de Lothlórien
## Context: Action-bar label while the player is in the Hated band (Harmony -30 to -60): the forest hates the player and its wardens attack on sight. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.status.hated=Haine de Lothlórien
## Context: Chat line when Harmony falls from Guest (or Friend) into the Uneasy band.. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.harmony.worse.uneasy=§6La forêt désapprouve tes actes.
## Context: Chat line when Harmony falls into the Shunned band (-15 to -29), from a better band.. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.harmony.worse.shunned=§cLa forêt te tourne le dos.
## Context: Chat line when Harmony falls into the Hated band (-30 or lower). Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.harmony.worse.hated=§4Les gardiens ne supportent plus ta présence.
## Context: Chat line when Harmony rises from Hated into the Shunned band. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.harmony.better.shunned=§cLes gardiens baissent leurs arcs, mais la forêt te rejette encore.
## Context: Chat line when Harmony rises from Shunned (or Hated) into the Uneasy band. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.harmony.better.uneasy=§6La colère de la forêt se change en malaise.
## Context: Chat line when Harmony rises from Uneasy (or lower) back to Guest (0). Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.harmony.better.guest=§aLes bois te pardonnent.
## Context: A short hint after a deed (a kill) that lowered Harmony without changing the band: the forest noticed. Harmony is a per-player number from -60 to +10 with five bands: Friend (+10), Guest (0 to +9), Uneasy (-1 to -14), Shunned (-15 to -29), Hated (-30 to -60). Deeds against the forest's creatures lower it; peaceful time inside the forest raises it.
lothlorien.message.harmony.hint=§7Les arbres se taisent autour de toi.
